sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Browser
  participant A as Sponsor authorizer
  participant P as OnboardingPaymaster
  participant R as Private RPC
  participant E as EntryPoint
  U->>A: Bounded unsigned activation
  A-->>U: Short-lived paymaster authorization
  U->>U: Passkey signs final UserOperation
  U->>R: Private submission
  R->>E: handleOps
  E->>P: validatePaymasterUserOp
  E-->>U: Atomic activation receipt
